 "about": [
  "[addon] api_min / [plugin] api_min of addon.ltx (11-catalog-distribution.md 6).",
  "parse: 'in' is the value as the ini reader gives it (' ', TAB, CR, LF around it already trimmed; an empty value 'api_min =' is no key for the readers and never reaches the parser - it is here for the parser alone).",
  "value: the lenient reader - MAJOR, MAJOR.MINOR or MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH, up to 9 decimal digits each, the missing parts 0, MAJOR and MINOR <= 1023, PATCH <= 4095; null - an error of the manifest. Engine ParseVersion (xray-16/src/xrGame/addon_host.cpp), launcher addon_catalog.rs parse_api.",
  "strict: the catalog form - exactly MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH in the same limits (the engine reads the others with a warning). Engine ParseVersion + ParseAddonVersion, validator gwcat/ltx.py parse_api_version, launcher addon_author.rs parse_api_version.",
  "compat: api_min against the API version of the engine - unset (0.0.0: no requirement), ok, newer_game (needs a newer game), addon_update (made for an older major). Engine ApiMinFit + ApiMinAdvice, launcher addon_catalog.rs api_compat."
 ],
